    "Instance profile",
    "• Avoid storing access key and secret key locally on EC2",
    "• Allows you to attach an IAM role to an EC2 instance",
    "• Automatic propagation of access keys to instances",
    "• Automatic rotation of access keys multiple times daily",
    "• Use across multiple instances (e.g., Auto Scaling group)",
    "Example: Grant EC2 instances permission to access the Amazon S3 buckets",
    "where application data is stored.",
    "Best Practice",
    "Do not store permanent access keys on EC2 instances,",
    "because credentials could be compromised."
   ],
