    "• Find by name, not AMI ID",
    "• Amazon Linux AMIs",
    "• Available for years",
    "Query the latest Amazon Linux AMI",
    "aws ssm get-parameters-by-path --path \"/aws/service/ami-amazon-linux-latest\"",
