    "On-Demand",
    "• Low cost and flexibility",
    "• Short term, spiky, or",
    "unpredictable workloads",
    "• Applications being developed or",
    "tested",
    "Reserved",
    "• No Upfront RI does not require an upfront",
    "payment",
    "• Up to 75% discount compared to On-Demand",
    "pricing and capacity reservations",
    "• Steady state or predictable usage",
    "• Require reserved capacity",
    "• Flexible start and end times",
    "• Feasible at very low compute prices",
    "• Urgent computing needs with",
    "steep discounts",
    "• Large amounts of additional",
    "capacity",
